"stationTitle": "Métro stations closed on Saturday",
"stationNote": "RATP announced these closures at the request of the Préfecture de police: trains pass through without stopping and there are no connections. The stations closed from 12:00 reopen only when the prefecture allows it. République, Oberkampf and Richard-Lenoir are not on the list, but the prefecture can add closures at short notice. Line 6 ends at Kléber from 08:00. Station positions on the map are approximate. Several bus routes will be diverted.",
"traffic": "No public transport strike is announced. Slow-roll road protests are possible on the Périphérique and airport motorways, and the interior ministry says blockades of key roads and facilities will not be tolerated. School holidays start, so expect heavy road traffic out of Paris.",
