"note": "A prefecture order bans any gathering at Place de la Bastille. The rally first called here for 14:00 is now reported to start at République instead. Bastille métro closes from 12:00. Calls to gather at Bastille and at Porte des Lilas are also circulating, with no times or routes published. People may still turn up, so expect police.",
